# 15. Transaction semantics

This section is mandatory.

Classify custom metrics as:

SUCCESS METRICS:

    must increment only after successful commit

FAILURE / REJECTION METRICS:

    increment when the corresponding failure/rejection occurs

For example:

Area UPDATE request
       ↓
transaction
       ↓
rollback
       ↓
area.updated MUST NOT increment

but:

VERSION_CONFLICT
       ↓
409
       ↓
version.conflict MAY increment

Define exact semantics before implementation.

